<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Table 5: </span><span id="S5.T5.fig2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Time efficiency of InfoSeeker.</span> We evaluate all methods on the <span id="S5.T5.fig2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">stack single block</span> task, with a fixed wall-clock time of 1 minute per trial. InfoSeeker demonstrates the highest efficiency, achieving a <math id="S5.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="36\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">36\%</annotation></semantics></math> performance improvement over the previous state-of-the-art, LLM3.</figcaption>
